	(text "LEDS: XL-1606 side-view, bottom edge (1.1-1.5 mA)\nD5 green: VBUS-2k, (5.0-2.6)/2k = 1.2 mA.\n   Lit with USB present, 0 on battery.\nD1 red CHG: VSYS(4.4)-2k, Vf 1.8: 1.3 mA.\nD6 RGB, common anode to +3V3: R IO8 1k, G IO15 1k, B IO14 470R.\nSilkscreen: D5 PWR, D1 CHG, D6 USR.\nNo addressable LEDs: idle current."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 326.38 191.61 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.65 1.65)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5b8525d4-baea-5fb9-a23e-07a0498fd490")
	)
	(text "J2 pin 2 = BAT+\nJ2 pin 1 = BAT-\nQ2 blocks a reversed\ncell. Silkscreen:\nmark + and -"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 241.3 71.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5fef2f85-f81b-5c70-90d7-103d3e093b3e")
	)
	(text "J3 pin n = panel pin n (straight FPC). FPC-05FB-24PH20 is dual contact:\npanel tail wraps round the board edge, contacts face away from the PCB."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 275.59 0)
		(effects
			(font
