	)
	(text "PROGRAMMING (J4 pads)\n+3V3, GND, EN, IO9/BOOT, TXD0, RXD0.\n2x3 pads at 2.54 mm: pogo clip or header.\nHold BOOT (or DN) low, pulse EN for download mode.\nPin 1 (+3V3) is sense/reference only: do not\nfeed 3.3 V with no battery fitted (RT9080\nback-feed)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 161.92 208.61 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.65 1.65)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b57b9a3e-5c02-5c1d-81e0-b2149965cfb2")
	)
	(text "BATTERY TEMPERATURE (TS)\nTH1 10k NTC B3950 (0603): place against the\ncell. R8 10k (DNP) is the fallback.\n75 uA bias trips at 0.30 V and 2.1 V:\ncharging 3.5..47.2 C (resume < 44.7, > 6.5 C).\nBias flows only while VBUS is present."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 326.38 218.61 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.65 1.65)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ba502c93-241e-51e3-8135-d1947899a44f")
	)
	(text "BATTERY\nQ2 (AO3400A) in the BAT- lead blocks a\nreversed cell. MAX17048 and BQ24073 see\nsystem GND. Mark + and - on the J2 silk."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 244.38 212.61 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.65 1.65)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d73d73c9-3b70-5b33-87f8-5101222a5780")
	)
