	(text "BRING-UP\nSleep current: replace R13 (0R, LDO_OUT to\n+3V3) with an ammeter. Include the e-paper\nboost path in the measurement.\nTest pads: VBUS, VBAT, VSYS, +3V3, GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 244.38 191.61 0)
		(effects
